# 小屏, a finger: a page's list alone (src/sfbench/list_scene.mbt: 30 or 1,500 keys, following its foot, a spinner over
# it). At rest, a key appended at its foot (the scene's 1000 ms), two drags up and a fling, coasting; then the scene asks
# it to its top (6000 ms) and back to its foot (6500 ms), each at once.
timeout 20000
until message
log measure
wait 1300
drag 195 300 0 430 1000
drag 195 300 0 430 1000
drag 195 300 0 600 90
wait 3700
exit
